  "description": {
   "en": "Is the person you fall in love with really human? \"The Law of Silence\"\n\nMimiko has been able to hear the voices of anything since she was little. However, she follows a rule that she must never speak to these things, as her soul will be eaten and she will lose her life. One day, when she turns 14, she decides to keep an ornamental fish. The fish, which she sees as a beautiful boy, secretly falls in love with her. She doesn't need to speak. Just being together with it is enough...\n\n1: The Law of Silence『言無しの掟』(from Horror M, July 1998)\n2: Evil Eye『ジャノメ』(from Horror M, April 1999)\n3: Kage Musha『影武者』(debut work, from Horror M, selected June 1998, printed September, Horror M Newcomer Award winner)\n4: Black Hole『黒穴』(from Horror M, December 1999)\n5: Deadly Company『死カンパニー』(from Horror M, February 1999)\n6: Invert『反転』(from Horror M, June 1999)\n7: Rain Goddess『アメフラシ』\n8: Phantoms『幻妖団』(from Horror M, October 1999)\n9: Marie『マリエ』(All Kaidan No.12, November 1999)\n10: The Seventh Month『七の月』(from Horror M, January 1999)"
  },
